---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="tc-container">
    <div class="site-footer__inner">
      <div class="site-footer__brand">
        <a href="/" class="site-footer__wordmark" aria-label="tentacode.dev — accueil">
          <svg class="wm-octo" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7 16.5C7 10.7 11 7 16 7s9 3.7 9 9.5v.8c0 .7-.6 1.2-1.3 1.2H8.3C7.6 18.5 7 18 7 17.3Z" fill="currentColor"/>
            <path d="M11 19l-4 3.2 4 3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M21 19l4 3.2-4 3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M18 19l-4 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="12.6" cy="13.4" r="2.2" fill="var(--tc-fg-1)"/>
            <circle cx="19.4" cy="13.4" r="2.2" fill="var(--tc-fg-1)"/>
            <circle cx="13" cy="13.7" r="1" fill="var(--tc-accent)"/>
            <circle cx="19.8" cy="13.7" r="1" fill="var(--tc-accent)"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="wm-text">tentacode<span class="wm-dot">.</span>dev</span>
        </a>
        <p class="site-footer__joke">
          Bravo, t'as scrollé jusqu'en bas. À ce niveau de motivation, le café est offert — préviens-moi, je prépare la machine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="Pages">
        <h2 class="footer-nav__heading">Pages</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#axes">Compétences</a></li>
          <li><a href="#projects">Projets</a></li>
          <li><a href="#confs">Conférences</a></li>
          <li><a href="#blog">Blog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav aria-label="Ailleurs">
        <h2 class="footer-nav__heading">Ailleurs</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/tentacode" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub<span class="tc-sr"> (ouvre un nouvel onglet)</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gabrielpillet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn<span class="tc-sr"> (ouvre un nouvel onglet)</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="https://bsky.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bluesky<span class="tc-sr"> (ouvre un nouvel onglet)</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/rss.xml">Flux RSS</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav aria-label="Contact">
        <h2 class="footer-nav__heading">Contact</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="mailto:hello@tentacode.dev">hello@tentacode.dev</a></li>
          <li>
            <a class="footer-extlink" href="https://cv.tentacode.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              CV en ligne
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/>
                <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="tc-sr">(ouvre un nouvel onglet)</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="site-footer__legal">
      <span>© 2026 Gabriel Pillet — fait avec soin et un peu trop de café.</span>
      <span>v0.1 — design en cours</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    background: var(--tc-fg-1); color: var(--tc-bg);
    padding: var(--tc-space-8) 0 var(--tc-space-6);
  }
  .site-footer__inner {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--tc-space-6);
  }
  .site-footer__brand { max-width: 30ch; }
  .site-footer__wordmark {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    font-family: var(--tc-font-display);
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--tc-bg); text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .site-footer__wordmark .wm-octo { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: none; }
  .site-footer__wordmark .wm-dot { color: var(--tc-accent); }
  .site-footer__joke {
    margin: var(--tc-space-3) 0 0;
    font-size: 14px; color: #C8BFBC; line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .footer-nav__heading {
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--tc-accent);
    margin: 0 0 var(--tc-space-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-weight: var(--tc-weight-semibold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-family: var(--tc-font-sans);
  }
  .site-footer ul {
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  }
  .site-footer ul a {
    color: var(--tc-bg); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .site-footer ul a:hover,
  .site-footer ul a:focus-visible { text-decoration: underline; }
  .site-footer ul a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--tc-accent); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 2px; }

  .footer-extlink { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .footer-extlink svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; opacity: 0.7; }
  .footer-extlink:hover svg { opacity: 1; }

  .site-footer__legal {
    margin-top: var(--tc-space-7); padding-top: var(--tc-space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid #2A2A2A;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--tc-space-4);
    font-family: var(--tc-font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: #888;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .site-footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .site-footer__legal { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
